      "created_at": "2015-07-23T01:20:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I first started playing Sentinels (playing mostly just the Enhanced Edition), I thought Voss was the hardest villain. &nbsp;In retrospect, we had a few lucky games against Dawn and a few unlucky ones against Voss, but that didn't stop me from fearing Voss for a long time. &nbsp;Nowadays I beat Voss far &nbsp;more often than he beats me, but I still wanted to beat him down in the most humiliating way possible. The attached pic shows how I managed to do just that. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:07.218Z",
