      "created_at": "2015-07-23T01:51:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yessir. At the end of the game I had every card from Voss' deck under Savage Mana (Twist the Ether to take out the ships) including all three Forced Deployments. On his turn I was redirecting his damage to Legacy who was immune and he had no cards to play. Voss was completely at my mercy so I rampaged twice to eat every Imbued hero card except Savage Mana.&nbsp;</p>",
